<Behavior #ai-package-topology-and-membrane-composition apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" version="1" (
  <Requirements [
    <Requirement #ai-package-topology-shall-be-renamed-and-regrouped-around-core-organ-support-composer-and-membrane-ownership (
      <Statement ?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8ND9>
      系统应当将当前 AI 相关 package topology 重构为 `ai-core-*`、`ai-organ-*`、`ai-support`、`ai-composer` 与 `membrane` 的明确分层，而不是继续保留 `domain-ai-*` 与历史 ownership 混杂状态。
      </?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8ND9>
      <Suites [
        <Suite { name = "ai-package-topology-shall-be-renamed-and-regrouped-around-core-organ-support-composer-and-membrane-ownership" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #existing-domain-ai-packages-are-renamed-into-ai-core-and-ai-support-hosts { name = "Existing domain-ai packages are renamed into ai-core and ai-support hosts" } [
              <Then ?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDA>
              它们必须分别由 `@cell/ai-core-contract`、`@cell/ai-core-logic`、`@cell/ai-support` 承接正式 ownership
              </?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDA>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDB>
              旧 package 不得继续作为长期正式宿主
              </?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDB>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDC>
              当前仓库存在 `@cell/domain-ai-contract`、`@cell/domain-ai-logic`、`@cell/domain-ai-support`
              </?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDC>
              <When ?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDD>
              本轮 package topology 重构完成
              </?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDD>
            )>
            <Case #ai-specific-organ-ownership-is-split-out-into-dedicated-ai-organ-packages { name = "AI-specific organ ownership is split out into dedicated ai-organ packages" } [
              <Then ?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDE>
              必须新增 `@cell/ai-organ-contract` 与 `@cell/ai-organ-logic`
              </?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDE>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDF>
              它们应分别承接 AI-specific organ data / organ logic 的正式 ownership
              </?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDF>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDG>
              当前 `@cell/organ-contract` 与 `@cell/organ-logic` 同时承载 AI-specific 组织层契约与逻辑
              </?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDG>
              <When ?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDH>
              本轮重构完成
              </?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDH>
            )>
            <Case #legacy-organ-packages-are-deleted-after-source-migration { name = "Legacy organ packages are deleted after source migration" } [
              <Then ?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDJ>
              这些源码必须迁入 `@cell/ai-organ-contract` 与 `@cell/ai-organ-logic`
              </?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDJ>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDK>
              旧 `organ-*` 包、workspace alias 与 package 注册必须被删除，而不得继续保留第二套正式源码真相
              </?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDK>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDM>
              当前 `@cell/organ-contract` 与 `@cell/organ-logic` 仍保留一部分 AI runtime 相关源码
              </?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDM>
              <When ?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDN>
              本轮 ownership cutover 完成
              </?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDN>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
    <Requirement #ai-composer-ownership-shall-belong-to-cell-ai-composer-rather-than-ai-core-logic (
      <Statement ?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDP>
      系统应当让 AI runtime composition contract、profile/extension reducer 与 runtime deps composition helper 的正式宿主变为 `@cell/ai-composer`，而不是继续让 composer 逻辑散落到 runtime entry 或 `ai-core-logic` 中。
      </?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDP>
      <Suites [
        <Suite { name = "ai-composer-ownership-shall-belong-to-cell-ai-composer-rather-than-ai-core-logic" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #composer-is-renamed-and-aligned-with-composer-style-responsibility { name = "Composer is renamed and aligned with composer-style responsibility" } [
              <Then ?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDQ>
              该包必须迁移并改名为 `@cell/ai-composer`
              </?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDQ>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDR>
              其职责必须是组合层职责
              </?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDR>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDS>
              当前 `@cell/composer` 已承担 runtime assembly contract 与 profile reduction
              </?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDS>
              <When ?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDT>
              本轮重构完成
              </?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDT>
            )>
            <Case #core-logic-does-not-become-the-fallback-host-for-composition-ownership { name = "Core logic does not become the fallback host for composition ownership" } [
              <Then ?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDV>
              `ai-core-logic` 不得成为 composer ownership 的正式宿主
              </?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDV>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDW>
              runtime composition contract 不得继续私下回流到 logic 包
              </?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDW>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDX>
              `ai-core-logic` 负责 AI core runtime glue 和 host-facing helper
              </?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDX>
              <When ?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDY>
              本轮 package ownership 被审查
              </?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDY>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
    <Requirement #ai-support-shall-own-environment-implementations-and-support-bundle-creation (
      <Statement ?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDZ>
      系统应当让 `@cell/ai-support` 成为 AI 宿主环境实现与 support bundle factory 的正式宿主，而不是继续让 profile/composer 组合链直接正式拥有本地文件实现。
      </?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NDZ>
      <Suites [
        <Suite { name = "ai-support-shall-own-environment-implementations-and-support-bundle-creation" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #mod-profiles-no-longer-own-localfile-support-implementations-as-formal-runtime-backends { name = "Mod profiles no longer own LocalFile support implementations as formal runtime backends" } [
              <Then ?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NE0>
              这些本地宿主实现的正式 ownership 必须迁入 `@cell/ai-support`
              </?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NE0>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NE1>
              `mod-ai-kernel` 不得继续作为它们的正式宿主
              </?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NE1>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NE2>
              当前 `mod-ai-kernel` 仍直接使用 `LocalFile*` support 实现
              </?01M05F1P0JB4R2D3Q0J1SS8NE2>
              <When ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K0E>
              本轮 topology 重构完成
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K0E>
            )>
            <Case #ai-support-becomes-the-formal-host-for-runtime-support-bundle-creation { name = "AI support becomes the formal host for runtime support bundle creation" } [
              <Then ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K0F>
              这些能力必须通过 `@cell/ai-support` 提供的正式 support 宿主获得
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K0F>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K0G>
              runtime entry 不得继续绕过 support host 直接拼接默认本地实现
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K0G>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K0H>
              runtime entry 需要 message history、orchestration history、snapshot repository、permission store、agent loader 等环境能力
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K0H>
              <When ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K0J>
              runtime 进行正式装配
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K0J>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
    <Requirement #ai-organ-contract-shall-own-runtimedeps-and-other-ai-specific-organization-layer-contracts (
      <Statement ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K0K>
      系统应当让 `@cell/ai-organ-contract` 成为 AI-specific 组织层依赖组合与相关 contract 的正式宿主。
      </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K0K>
      <Suites [
        <Suite { name = "ai-organ-contract-shall-own-runtimedeps-and-other-ai-specific-organization-layer-contracts" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #runtimedeps-moves-into-ai-organ-contract { name = "RuntimeDeps moves into ai-organ-contract" } [
              <Then ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K0M>
              这些 contract 必须定义在 `@cell/ai-organ-contract`
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K0M>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K0N>
              不得继续挂在错误的 core 或历史 organ ownership 下
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K0N>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K0P>
              runtime 需要组合 core contract、support bundle 和组织层运行时依赖
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K0P>
              <When ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K0Q>
              定义 `RuntimeDeps` 或等价的组织层依赖组合结构
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K0Q>
            )>
            <Case #ai-specific-permission-and-persistence-contracts-are-reviewed-for-organ-ownership { name = "AI-specific permission and persistence contracts are reviewed for organ ownership" } [
              <Then ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K0R>
              AI-specific 的组织层 contract 必须迁入 `@cell/ai-organ-contract`
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K0R>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K0S>
              非 AI-generic 的内容不应继续混在历史泛化 ownership 中
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K0S>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K0T>
              权限配置、派生索引、组织层恢复等 contract 当前分散在历史 organ 包中
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K0T>
              <When ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K0V>
              完成本轮重构
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K0V>
            )>
            <Case #legacy-organ-contract-package-is-removed-after-contract-migration { name = "Legacy organ-contract package is removed after contract migration" } [
              <Then ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K0W>
              上述 contract 的源码真相必须位于 `@cell/ai-organ-contract`
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K0W>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K0X>
              `@cell/organ-contract` 的目录、tsconfig alias 与 package 依赖声明必须被删除
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K0X>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K0Y>
              `organ-contract` 中仍存在 `DelegateRunMode`、`AgentCatalogLoader`、`MemberRole`、`LocalPermissionConfig`、`RuntimeDerivedIndexes` 等源码文件
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K0Y>
              <When ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K0Z>
              `ai-organ-contract` 成为正式宿主
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K0Z>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
    <Requirement #ai-organ-logic-shall-own-orchestration-organization-coordination-and-recovery-logic (
      <Statement ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K10>
      系统应当让 `@cell/ai-organ-logic` 承担 AI-specific orchestration / organization / coordination / permission runtime / runtime recovery 等组织层逻辑。
      </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K10>
      <Suites [
        <Suite { name = "ai-organ-logic-shall-own-orchestration-organization-coordination-and-recovery-logic" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #ai-organization-logic-moves-into-ai-organ-logic { name = "AI organization logic moves into ai-organ-logic" } [
              <Then ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K11>
              这些逻辑必须由 `@cell/ai-organ-logic` 承接正式 ownership
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K11>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K12>
              不得继续长期停留在历史混合 ownership 中
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K12>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K13>
              当前 `organ-logic` 中存在 MemberManager、OrganizationManager、CoordinationEngine、TaskTreeManager 等 AI-specific 组织逻辑
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K13>
              <When ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K14>
              本轮 topology 重构完成
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K14>
            )>
            <Case #runtime-recovery-and-coordination-paths-are-reviewed-for-organ-logic-ownership { name = "Runtime recovery and coordination paths are reviewed for organ logic ownership" } [
              <Then ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K15>
              这些 AI-specific 组织层逻辑应优先归入 `@cell/ai-organ-logic`
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K15>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K16>
              `ai-core-logic` 不应被迫承担组织层职责
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K16>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K17>
              runtime recovery、coordinator、detached actor coordination 等逻辑当前位于历史 organ host
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K17>
              <When ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K18>
              评审新的 AI package topology
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K18>
            )>
            <Case #ai-organ-logic-depends-on-ai-core-logic-rather-than-the-reverse { name = "ai-organ-logic depends on ai-core-logic rather than the reverse" } [
              <Then ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K19>
              `@cell/ai-organ-logic` 可以依赖 `@cell/ai-core-logic`
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K19>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1A>
              `@cell/ai-core-logic` 不得反向依赖 `@cell/ai-organ-logic`
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1A>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1B>
              `ai-core-logic` 承担 AI core facade、graph 与配置解析等 core 级能力
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1B>
              <When ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1C>
              shell runtime、LLM、MCP、runtime bootstrap 与组织层协调能力被重新分层
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1C>
            )>
            <Case #legacy-organ-logic-package-is-removed-after-logic-migration { name = "Legacy organ-logic package is removed after logic migration" } [
              <Then ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1D>
              这些源码必须迁入 `@cell/ai-organ-logic` 并以其为主要导入面
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1D>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1E>
              `@cell/organ-logic` 的目录、测试目录、tsconfig alias 与 package 依赖声明必须迁移并删除
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1E>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1F>
              `organ-logic` 中仍保留 delegate actor、tool composer、llm、stream、permission runtime、task tree、questionnaire 与 holon orchestration 等 AI runtime 逻辑源码
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1F>
              <When ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1G>
              `ai-organ-logic` 成为正式宿主
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1G>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
    <Requirement #ai-core-contract-and-logic-shall-own-all-ai-specific-core-data-and-behavior (
      <Statement ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1H>
      系统应当让 `@cell/ai-core-contract` 与 `@cell/ai-core-logic` 成为 AI core 层数据与逻辑的唯一正式宿主，而不是继续让 `core-contract` / `core-logic` 保留 AI-specific 真相源。
      </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1H>
      <Suites [
        <Suite { name = "ai-core-contract-and-logic-shall-own-all-ai-specific-core-data-and-behavior" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #ai-specific-logic-is-extracted-from-core-logic-into-ai-core-logic { name = "AI-specific logic is extracted from core-logic into ai-core-logic" } [
              <Then ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1J>
              这些 AI-specific 逻辑必须迁入 `@cell/ai-core-logic`
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1J>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1K>
              若原实现把数据与方法混在同一对象中，应拆成 AI core data 与以该数据为首参数的静态逻辑函数后再迁移
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1K>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1M>
              `cell/packages/core-logic` 中仍保留 AI runtime actor、VM、semantic graph、LLM stage pipeline、runtime transcript、config loader 等 AI 领域专属逻辑
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1M>
              <When ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1N>
              本轮 core ownership cutover 完成
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1N>
            )>
            <Case #ai-specific-data-moves-into-ai-core-contract { name = "AI-specific data moves into ai-core-contract" } [
              <Then ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1P>
              这些 AI-specific 数据定义必须迁入 `@cell/ai-core-contract`
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1P>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1Q>
              `@cell/ai-core-logic` 只能保留逻辑实现与 facade，而不再私藏第二套数据真相
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1Q>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1R>
              `cell/packages/core-contract` 与 `cell/packages/core-logic` 中仍保留 AI runtime actor / VM / stream / coordination / questionnaire / LLM / snapshot 等数据定义
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1R>
              <When ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1S>
              本轮 core ownership cutover 完成
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1S>
            )>
            <Case #legacy-ai-compatibility-layers-are-removed-from-core-packages { name = "Legacy AI compatibility layers are removed from core packages" } [
              <Then ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1T>
              `core-contract` 与 `core-logic` 下不再保留 AI 领域专属源码或 compatibility shell
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1T>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1V>
              仓库活动 consumer 必须切到 `@cell/ai-core-contract` / `@cell/ai-core-logic`
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1V>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1W>
              `@cell/core-contract` 与 `@cell/core-logic` 曾在迁移期通过 compatibility export 暴露 AI-specific surface
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1W>
              <When ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1X>
              `ai-core-*` 成为正式宿主
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1X>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
    <Requirement #membrane-shall-become-a-higher-level-composer-facade-host (
      <Statement ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1Y>
      系统应当让 `@cell/membrane` 成为位于 `@cell/ai-composer` 之上的更高层 facade 聚合面，以便未来继续封装更多领域 composer，而不是继续维持空壳状态。
      </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1Y>
      <Suites [
        <Suite { name = "membrane-shall-become-a-higher-level-composer-facade-host" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #membrane-wraps-ai-composer-as-a-higher-level-runtime-composition-facade { name = "Membrane wraps ai-composer as a higher-level runtime composition facade" } [
              <Then ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1Z>
              `@cell/membrane` 应能封装 `@cell/ai-composer` 并暴露更高层 facade
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K1Z>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K20>
              membrane 不得继续只是无职责 re-export 壳
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K20>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K21>
              `@cell/ai-composer` 提供 AI 领域 runtime composition 能力
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K21>
              <When ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K22>
              高层 consumer 需要更产品化或更上层的 facade
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K22>
            )>
            <Case #membrane-remains-extensible-to-future-composers { name = "Membrane remains extensible to future composers" } [
              <Then ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K23>
              它必须允许在 AI composer 之外继续聚合更多领域 composer
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K23>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K24>
              不得把 membrane 设计成只服务单一当前实现的临时命名层
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K24>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K25>
              未来仓库可能引入更多领域的 composer
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K25>
              <When ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K26>
              设计 membrane 的正式职责
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K26>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
    <Requirement #terminal-consumers-shall-depend-on-appropriate-facade-layers-rather-than-a-single-forced-entrypoint (
      <Statement ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K27>
      系统应当允许 `terminal/*` 按职责引用不同层级的 `cell/*` facade/contract，但必须保持明确的层级消费边界，避免无边界地直接拉取内部实现细节。
      </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K27>
      <Suites [
        <Suite { name = "terminal-consumers-shall-depend-on-appropriate-facade-layers-rather-than-a-single-forced-entrypoint" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #terminal-is-not-forced-to-consume-membrane-as-the-only-entrypoint { name = "Terminal is not forced to consume membrane as the only entrypoint" } [
              <Then ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K28>
              `terminal/*` 可以引用 `membrane` 或其他合适层级的 `cell/*` facade
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K28>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K29>
              系统不得强制规定 terminal 只能通过 membrane 访问所有能力
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K29>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K2A>
              不同 terminal 子包对 runtime composition、runtime bridge、host glue 的抽象需求不同
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K2A>
              <When ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K2B>
              评审新的 package topology
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K2B>
            )>
            <Case #terminal-consumers-use-layer-appropriate-facades { name = "Terminal consumers use layer-appropriate facades" } [
              <Then ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K2C>
              它们应按职责消费对应层级的 facade/contract
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K2C>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K2D>
              不得越级拉取大量 composer/support/mod internals 形成新的耦合真相
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K2D>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K2E>
              `terminal/core`、`terminal/organ`、`terminal/tui`、`terminal/cli` 的职责层级不同
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K2E>
              <When ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K2F>
              它们需要消费 AI runtime 相关能力
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K2F>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
    <Requirement #migration-shall-preserve-compatibility-through-an-explicit-cutover-plan (
      <Statement ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K2G>
      系统应当通过显式迁移计划完成新 package topology 的切换，而不是要求全仓一次性无保护改名。
      </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K2G>
      <Suites [
        <Suite { name = "migration-shall-preserve-compatibility-through-an-explicit-cutover-plan" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #only-non-organ-legacy-packages-may-keep-temporary-compatibility-shells { name = "Only non-organ legacy packages may keep temporary compatibility shells" } [
              <Then ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K2H>
              除 `organ-contract` / `organ-logic` 外的旧 package 可以在迁移期保留 forwarding shell 或等价兼容层
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K2H>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K2J>
              这些兼容层必须被标记为过渡方案，而非长期正式宿主
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K2J>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K2K>
              旧 package 名称已被多个 consumer 和测试使用
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K2K>
              <When ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K2M>
              本轮 rename 和 ownership cutover 开始
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K2M>
            )>
            <Case #focused-tests-guard-the-new-package-topology-and-facade-ownership { name = "Focused tests guard the new package topology and facade ownership" } [
              <Then ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K2N>
              应存在 focused tests 锁定 package ownership、membrane facade、terminal adoption 与兼容层 cutover 行为
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K2N>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K2P>
              迁移后不应继续留下第二套正式 package ownership 真相源
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K2P>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K2Q>
              本轮会影响 package name、导入路径、ownership 和 facade 使用边界
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K2Q>
              <When ?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K2R>
              实现完成
              </?01M05F1P0KD8G0WDR6EB686K2R>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
  ]>
)>
